1. Implement actual server-side validation for ad network callbacks (in `firebase-functions/src/index.ts`).
2. Implement actual server-side validation for in-app purchases (in `firebase-functions/src/index.ts`).
3. Refine the logic for updating user statistics, specifically how 'games played' is incremented in the `submitGuess` function (in `firebase-functions/src/index.ts`).
