5. Implement proper logic for determining the next riddle and handling the end-of-riddles scenario in the `skipRiddle` function (in `firebase-functions/src/index.ts`).
6. Add more robust logic and handling for different form types in the `processFormSubmission` function (in `firebase-functions/src/index.ts`).
